{"abstract":"Peer review is our best tool for judging the quality of conference submissions, but it is becoming increasingly spurious. We argue that a part of the problem is that the reviewers and area chairs face a poorly defined task forcing apples-to-oranges comparisons. There are several potential ways forward, but the key difficulty is creating the incentives and mechanisms for their consistent implementation in the NLP community.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Rogers, Anna","Augenstein, Isabelle"],"cuid":["S02-084.30-692207"],"event":{"acronym":"EMNLP","end":"2020-11-20","place":"online","start":"2020-11-16","title":"The 2020 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing","year":"2020"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Conference submissions","Evaluation criteria","Incentive mechanisms","NLP community","Peer review"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"what can we do to improve peer review in nlp","src":["itu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.18653/v1/2020.findings-emnlp.112","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-084.30-692207","identifier":[{"id":"85101806625","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-8ada8962-3c4b-44b0-ac36-251c9b353707","ku-f464713e-1976-445b-aedc-b9064992f527"],"keyword":["Conference submissions","Evaluation criteria","Incentive mechanisms","NLP community","Peer review"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-8573E225C3BABEB6CAAC638B5BBF1B71"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.18653/v1/2020.findings-emnlp.112","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/254996465/What_CanWe_Do_to_Improve_Peer_Review_in_NLP.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science, Machine Learning"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":2,"key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU"}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Anna","key":"rogerspau","last":"Rogers","name":"Rogers, Anna","orcid":"0000-0002-4845-4023","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Isabelle","key":"augensteinpau","last":"Augenstein","locid":"929ec255-2eae-4e6d-b826-5e7abd210f06","name":"Augenstein, Isabelle","orcid":"0000-0003-1562-7909","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.18653/v1/2020.findings-emnlp.112","pages":"1256-1262","publisher":"Association for Computational Linguistics","status":"p","title":"Findings of the Association for Computational Linguistics: EMNLP 2020"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","ITU IT University of Copenhagen","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-8ada8962-3c4b-44b0-ac36-251c9b353707","ku-f464713e-1976-445b-aedc-b9064992f527"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"What Can We Do to Improve Peer Review in NLP?","ty